{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Jolly Land Adventure</i> is a bite-sized 2D platformer bursting with charm. With smooth movement, cheerful visuals, and quick levels designed for replay, it\u2019s the perfect pick-me-up for platformer fans of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick up and play </strong>\u2013 No lengthy cutscenes or tutorials. Just start running and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Platforming Fun</strong> \u2013 Precise jumps, smooth movement, and creative level design keep the action exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Colorful &amp; Cozy World</strong> \u2013 Traverse lively landscapes filled with secrets, surprises, and quirky characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxed &amp; Accessible</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn, fun to replay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Try the  demo</strong> \u2013 30 free levels of tight, joyful platforming.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624050?t=1749496099","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624050?t=1749496099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624050/eb5258b8a3a4263c17307c04a11919b26ec5b898/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749496099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624050/eb5258b8a3a4263c17307c04a11919b26ec5b898/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749496099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3626740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Jolly Land Adventure</i> is a bite-sized 2D platformer bursting with charm. With smooth movement, cheerful visuals, and quick levels designed for repla